<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka ends steady in active market.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka ends steady in active market.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bangladesh taka closed steady at 42.8470/8485 to the dollar in an active interbank session on Wednesday, dealers said. The previous close was at 42.8460/8480.</p>
<p>The taka was quoted at 42.8450/8490 per dollar in early trade but most deals were done at 42.8470/5480 level.</p>
<p>The interbank call money rates closed at 7.5 to 8.0 percent, marginally up from 7.25-7.50 percent.</p>
<p>- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
